title: Party Organisations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: party_organizations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_organizations_timer = 6;
card-image: img/Mann_der_Arbeit.jpg
max-visits: 6

= Party Organisations

The SPD is more than a party. Around it stand the Arbeiterwohlfahrt, the Friedrich Ebert Foundation, the Jusos, and thousands of local associations. Many of them have been losing members for years.

- @newspapers: Invest in our media and online channels.
- @welfare: Fund the Arbeiterwohlfahrt's social work.
- @culture: Fund local party life: festivals, debates and neighbourhood offices.
- @youth: We have the reputation of being a party of pensioners. Support the Jusos.
- @nothing: Do not increase funding for any programme.
- @easy_discard

@newspapers
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; media_timer = 0;
go-to: media

@welfare
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; workers_aid += 1; unemployed_spd += 5*(1 - dissent); pensioners_spd += 1*(1-dissent)

We fund more counselling on debt, rent and benefits through the Arbeiterwohlfahrt. [? if recession_seen > 0 : In an economic crisis, this helps our standing among the unemployed. ?]

@culture
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; cultural_organizations += 1; left_dissent -= 6; center_dissent -= 6; labor_dissent -= 6; reformist_dissent -= 6

We open neighbourhood offices, hold summer festivals and invite people to debates who would never come to a party meeting. Our members feel more at home in the party, even when they dislike our policies.

@youth
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; young_socialists += 1; left_strength += 5; radicalization += 1; new_middle_spd += 1*(1-dissent)

New young members join through the Jusos. Most of them join the left of the party, and they bring new energy to our campaigns.

@nothing

We do not fund any party organisations.

- @return: Continue...
